{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"一、七年。春，宋皇瑗帥師侵鄭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"二、晉魏曼多帥師侵衞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"三、夏，公會吳于鄫。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"四、秋，公伐邾婁。八月己酉，入邾婁，以邾婁子益來。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"入不言伐，此其言伐何？內辭也，若使他人然。邾婁子益何以名？絕。曷為絕之？獲也。曷為不言其獲？內大惡，諱也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"五、宋人圍曹。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_234_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_234","textTraditional":"六、冬，鄭駟弘帥師救曹。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}